    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clockwork Maiden</strong></i> is a  3D platformer Action-Adventure set in a world of brass, steam, and smog, shaped by the relentless march of industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Mary</strong>, a wind-up automaton built for cleaning, now thrust into a race against the infamous <strong>Bell Family</strong>\u2014a ruthless syndicate of industrialists seeking to assemble the legendary <strong>Perpetual Motion Device</strong>. If they succeed, their unchecked machines will darken the skies, clog the rivers, and reduce the world to a wasteland of endless production and pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tick Tock \u2013 Stay Wound or Shut Down Forever!</strong> Keep Mary\u2019s key wound tight, or risk grinding to a halt in the middle of action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gears, Gauges, and Gadgets</strong> \u2013 Upgrade Mary\u2019s clockwork systems with new weapons and tools to stop the Bell Bots from turning the world into a junk heap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming &amp; Puzzling</strong> \u2013 Jump, run, and charge through sprawling industrial landscapes, testing your 3D platforming skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing World</strong> \u2013 Explore a vast 3D overworld, from opulent <strong>Victorian mansions</strong> and smog-choked cities to soaring <strong>wind-powered airships</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Colorful Cast of Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet a <strong>diverse array of allies and foes</strong>, each with their own role in this mechanical saga.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PSX Style</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the late-\u201990s golden era of 3D gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with gears, grime, and a whole lot of heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is ticking, Mary! Keep your key wound, and save the world before it runs out of steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <i>Motion Media Lab</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clockwork Maiden</strong></i> is a  3D platformer Action-Adventure set in a world of brass, steam, and smog, shaped by the relentless march of industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Mary</strong>, a wind-up automaton built for cleaning, now thrust into a race against the infamous <strong>Bell Family</strong>\u2014a ruthless syndicate of industrialists seeking to assemble the legendary <strong>Perpetual Motion Device</strong>. If they succeed, their unchecked machines will darken the skies, clog the rivers, and reduce the world to a wasteland of endless production and pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tick Tock \u2013 Stay Wound or Shut Down Forever!</strong> Keep Mary\u2019s key wound tight, or risk grinding to a halt in the middle of action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gears, Gauges, and Gadgets</strong> \u2013 Upgrade Mary\u2019s clockwork systems with new weapons and tools to stop the Bell Bots from turning the world into a junk heap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming &amp; Puzzling</strong> \u2013 Jump, run, and charge through sprawling industrial landscapes, testing your 3D platforming skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing World</strong> \u2013 Explore a vast 3D overworld, from opulent <strong>Victorian mansions</strong> and smog-choked cities to soaring <strong>wind-powered airships</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Colorful Cast of Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet a <strong>diverse array of allies and foes</strong>, each with their own role in this mechanical saga.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PSX Style</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the late-\u201990s golden era of 3D gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >