    "short_description": "Clockwork Maiden is a 3D Action-Adventure. Play as Mary, a Wind-up Maid fighting to stop the Bell Family from polluting the world. Keep her key wound, upgrade her gadgets, and explore Mansions, smog-choked cities, and airships in a retro PSX-inspired world before time runs out!",
